{
    "comment": "상품 폼 — 공통정보 구획. 여러 상품이 함께 쓰는 안내문을 골라 붙인다. 「기본값 따라가기」를 켜면\n  기본으로 지정된 안내문이 자동으로 걸리고 목록 선택은 잠긴다 — 나중에 기본값을 바꾸면 이 상품도\n  따라가게 하려는 것이다. 고른 안내문의 본문은 아래 접이식 카드에서 읽기 전용으로 보여 준다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Product Form - Common Info Section (시안 반영)"
    },
    "id": "common_info",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "props": {
        "className": "ecommerce-admin-card-accordion"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Button",
            "actions": [
                {
                    "comment": "구획 접기/펼치기",
                    "type": "click",
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": {
                        "target": "local",
                        "ui.commonInfoExpanded": "{{!_local.ui.commonInfoExpanded}}"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "props": {
                "type": "button",
                "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:w-full ecommerce:justify-start ecommerce:text-left ecommerce-card-header",
                "aria-expanded": "{{_local.ui.commonInfoExpanded !== false}}"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Icon",
                    "props": {
                        "name": "file-alt",
                        "className": "ecommerce-text-muted"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Span",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-card-title"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.sections.common_info"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Icon",
                    "props": {
                        "name": "chevron-down",
                        "className": "ecommerce-admin-card-accordion-icon ecommerce-text-muted ecommerce:transition-transform ecommerce:duration-200 {{_local.ui.commonInfoExpanded !== false ? 'ecommerce:rotate-180' : ''}}"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "common_info_body",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{_local.ui.commonInfoExpanded !== false}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "ecommerce-row-stack"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "id": "common_info_template_header",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "responsive": {
                        "portable": {
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-row-stack"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-between"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Label",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-form-label ecommerce:mb-0"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.fields.common_info"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "A",
                            "props": {
                                "href": "/admin/ecommerce/common-info",
                                "target": "_blank",
                                "rel": "noopener noreferrer",
                                "className": "ecommerce-btn ecommerce-btn-outline ecommerce:text-xs"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "arrow-up-right-from-square",
                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:mr-1.5"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.buttons.manage_common_info"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "use_default_common_info_toggle",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:gap-3"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "composite",
                            "name": "Toggle",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "켤 때 — 기본으로 지정된 안내문을 찾아 함께 걸어 준다(아래 목록이 잠기므로 여기서 골라 두지 않으면 아무것도 안 붙는다)",
                                    "type": "change",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "if": "{{$event.target.checked}}",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "form.use_default_common_info": true,
                                                "form.common_info_id": "{{(common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.is_default)?.id ?? null}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "hasChanges": true
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "comment": "끌 때 — 걸려 있던 안내문은 그대로 두고 목록만 연다(끄자마자 선택이 풀리면 다시 고르는 수고가 는다). 켬/끔을 두 블록으로 나눈 것은 한쪽만 조건이 다르기 때문이다",
                                    "type": "change",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "if": "{{!$event.target.checked}}",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "form.use_default_common_info": false
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "hasChanges": true
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "name": "use_default_common_info",
                                "checked": "{{_local.form.use_default_common_info ?? false}}",
                                "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-text-label"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.common_info.use_default"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "common_info_buttons_container",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{(common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).length > 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "{{_local.errors?.common_info_id ? 'ecommerce:flex ecommerce:flex-wrap ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:p-2 ecommerce:border ecommerce:border-red-500 ecommerce:dark:border-red-500 ecommerce:rounded-lg' : 'ecommerce:flex ecommerce:flex-wrap ecommerce:gap-2'}}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "common_info_none_button",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "「사용 안 함」 — 선택을 비우면서 아래 상세 카드도 함께 접는다(가리킬 안내문이 없어진 카드가 펼쳐진 채 남지 않도록)",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "form.common_info_id": null
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "ui.commonInfoDetailExpanded": false
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "hasChanges": true
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "{{!_local.form.common_info_id ? 'ecommerce:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:border-blue-600' : 'ecommerce:bg-white ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300 ecommerce:border-gray-300 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700'}} ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:border ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:transition-colors ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                "disabled": "{{_local.form.use_default_common_info || _computed.isReadOnly}}"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.common_info.none"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "common_info_default_button",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "if": "{{(common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).some(c => c.is_default)}}",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "기본 안내문 고르기 — 「따라가기」와 달리 지금 값만 붙이므로, 나중에 기본값이 바뀌어도 이 상품은 따라가지 않는다",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "form.common_info_id": "{{(common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.is_default)?.id}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "hasChanges": true
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "{{_local.form.common_info_id === (common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.is_default)?.id ? 'ecommerce:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:border-blue-600' : 'ecommerce:bg-white ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300 ecommerce:border-gray-300 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700'}} ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:border ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:transition-colors ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-1.5 ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                "disabled": "{{_local.form.use_default_common_info || _computed.isReadOnly}}"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "{{_local.form.common_info_id === (common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.is_default)?.id ? 'ecommerce:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:text-white' : 'ecommerce:bg-gray-200 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-600 ecommerce:text-gray-600 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300'}} ecommerce:px-1.5 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:rounded ecommerce:text-xs"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.common_info.badge_default"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "text": "{{$localized((common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.is_default)?.name)}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "common_info_other_buttons_wrapper_{{idx}}",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "iteration": {
                                "source": "{{(common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).filter(c => !c.is_default)}}",
                                "item_var": "commonInfo",
                                "index_var": "idx"
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:contents"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "id": "common_info_btn_{{commonInfo.id}}",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "기본값이 아닌 안내문 고르기",
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "sequence",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "form.common_info_id": "{{commonInfo.id}}"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "hasChanges": true
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "className": "{{_local.form.common_info_id === commonInfo.id ? 'ecommerce:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:border-blue-600' : 'ecommerce:bg-white ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300 ecommerce:border-gray-300 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700'}} ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:border ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:transition-colors ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                        "disabled": "{{_local.form.use_default_common_info || _computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{$localized(commonInfo.name)}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Span",
                    "if": "{{_local.errors?.common_info_id}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-form-error-xs ecommerce:mt-1"
                    },
                    "text": "{{_local.errors?.common_info_id?.[0]}}"
                },
                {
                    "id": "common_info_detail_accordion",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{_local.form.common_info_id}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-toggle-group"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "common_info_detail_header",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "고른 안내문의 본문을 접고 편다",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "local",
                                        "ui.commonInfoDetailExpanded": "{{!_local.ui.commonInfoDetailExpanded}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "ecommerce:w-full ecommerce:text-left ecommerce-flex-between ecommerce:p-4 ecommerce:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:cursor-pointer ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-100 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700 ecommerce:transition-colors",
                                "aria-expanded": "{{!!(_local.ui.commonInfoDetailExpanded)}}"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-primary ecommerce:font-medium"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{$localized((common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id === _local.form.common_info_id)?.name)}}"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "chevron-down",
                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-xl ecommerce-text-muted ecommerce:transition-transform ecommerce:duration-200 {{_local.ui.commonInfoDetailExpanded ? 'ecommerce:rotate-180' : ''}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "common_info_detail_body",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{_local.ui.commonInfoDetailExpanded}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:border-t ecommerce:border-gray-200 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-700"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "id": "common_info_locale_tabs",
                                    "type": "composite",
                                    "name": "MultilingualTabPanel",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "어느 언어 본문을 볼지. 탭은 내용이 실제로 채워진 언어만 세운다",
                                            "event": "onLocaleChange",
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "ui.commonInfoLocale": "{{$args[0]}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "variant": "underline",
                                        "className": "ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:pt-4",
                                        "locales": "{{Object.keys((common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id === _local.form.common_info_id)?.content ?? {}).filter(k => k && (common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id === _local.form.common_info_id)?.content?.[k])}}"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "common_info_content_display",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:p-4 ecommerce:max-h-96 ecommerce:overflow-y-auto"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "본문은 공통정보 관리 화면의 보기 패널과 같은 표시기로 그린다 — HTML 은 정화해 그리고, 텍스트는 줄바꿈을 살린다",
                                                    "id": "ext_html_content",
                                                    "type": "extension_point",
                                                    "name": "html_content",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "content": "{{(common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id === _local.form.common_info_id)?.content?.[_local.ui.commonInfoLocale ?? $locale] ?? ''}}",
                                                        "isHtml": "{{((common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id === _local.form.common_info_id)?.content_mode ?? 'text') === 'html'}}",
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:prose ecommerce:prose-sm ecommerce:dark:prose-invert ecommerce:max-w-none"
                                                    },
                                                    "default": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "composite",
                                                            "name": "HtmlContent",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "content": "{{(common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id === _local.form.common_info_id)?.content?.[_local.ui.commonInfoLocale ?? $locale] ?? ''}}",
                                                                "isHtml": "{{((common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id === _local.form.common_info_id)?.content_mode ?? 'text') === 'html'}}",
                                                                "className": "ecommerce:prose ecommerce:prose-sm ecommerce:dark:prose-invert ecommerce:max-w-none"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "공통정보 조회 권한이 없어 선택지가 비었을 때는 「등록된 공통정보 없음」 이 아니라 권한이 없다고 말한다 — 실재하는 안내문을 없다고 읽게 하지 않는다",
                    "id": "common_info_forbidden_notice",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{common_infos?.data?.unavailable === true}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:text-amber-700 ecommerce:dark:text-amber-300"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "circle-exclamation",
                                "className": "ecommerce:text-base"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.selector_forbidden.common_infos"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "common_info_empty_state",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{common_infos !== undefined && (common_infos?.data?.unavailable !== true && !(common_infos?.data?.data ?? []).length)}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:text-center ecommerce:py-8 ecommerce-text-muted"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:text-sm"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.common_info.empty"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
